sequenceDiagram
    actor SU as User (searcher)
    participant C as C: Consumer
    participant S as S: Search
    participant L as L: Listing
    actor U as User (pharmacy manager)
    participant PH as PH: Pharmacy
    participant VR as VR: VerificationRequest
    participant LD as LD: LicenseDocument
    participant AD as AD: Admin
    actor AU as User (administrator)

    Note over U,AU: Phase 1 - One-time registration and verification request (onboarding)

    U->>PH: register()
    PH->>VR: submit()
    VR->>VR: attachDocument()
    VR->>LD: upload()
    LD-->>VR: stored (storagePath)
    VR-->>PH: status = pending
    PH-->>U: Registration received (verification pending, listing not live)

    Note over U,AU: Phase 2 - Admin review

    AU->>AD: listPendingRequests()
    AD-->>AU: pending VerificationRequest(s)
    AU->>AD: reviewRegistration()
    AD->>VR: checkWithRegistry()
    VR->>LD: download()
    LD-->>VR: license document
    VR-->>AD: registry result

    opt registry unavailable or inconclusive
        AD->>AD: checkLicenseManually()
    end

    alt license valid
        AU->>AD: approve()
        AD->>VR: markVerified()
        Note over VR,PH: Pharmacy verificationStatus becomes verified
        VR-->>AD: verified
        AD-->>AU: Registration approved
    else license invalid
        AU->>AD: reject()
        AD->>VR: markRejected()
        VR-->>AD: rejected (rejectionReason stored)
        AD-->>AU: Registration rejected
    end

    Note over SU,AU: Phase 3 - Searcher sees only verified pharmacies, with the verified indicator

    SU->>C: searchMedicine()
    C->>S: matchProduct(queryText, origin)
    S->>S: findListings()

    loop each Listing
        S->>L: isInStock()
        L->>PH: isVisibleInSearch()
        PH->>PH: isVerified()
        alt verified (listing is live)
            PH-->>L: visible and verified
            L-->>S: stock, price, lastUpdated, verified indicator
        else pending or rejected (listing not live)
            PH-->>L: not visible
            L-->>S: excluded from results
        end
    end

    S->>S: filterVerifiedOnly()
    S-->>C: results with "verified pharmacy" indicator
    C-->>SU: results